- Y1: Similar improvement ratios on Tm (~54% gap explanation) and Egc
- Y2: Direct transfer matches property-to-property transfer
- Y3: Same mechanisms validated: fingerprint 60-75%, τ=0.05 optimal
- Y4: Multi-task training improves by 5-10% RMSE over single-task
- Y6: Error correlation across Tg/Tm/Egc validates shared representation bottleneck

